SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn 1

RATES
Calcite_kin
-start
10 REM rate = k * SA (mol/s)
20 rate = 0.001 * 10
30 moles = rate * time
40 SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite_kin
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -steps 10 in 100
        -formula CaCO3 1

INCREMENTAL_REACTIONS true

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selout.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals C
